/* -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

/**
 * `conversationStore` is read constantly (hubPulse, pushNotifier, the speaker's
 * periodic mtime scan, every `listConversations` call) and each read used to
 * re-`JSON.parse` the file unconditionally. This cache makes a read a no-op
 * (no `readFile`, no re-parse) when the file's mtime hasn't moved since the
 * last read — the common case, since most conversations are read far more
 * often than they're written.
